<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>5-Day Tanzania Safari Inquiry</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #b85c38;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .content {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #b85c38;
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #5c6239;
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .placeholder {
            color: #c0392b;
            font-weight: bold;
            background: #fadbd8;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 20px;
            background: white;
        }

        th,
        td {
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #5c6239;
            color: white;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #777;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Safaria Inquiry Template</h1>
        <p>5-Day Northern Circuit (Tarangire, Ngorongoro, Lake Manyara)</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p><strong>Subject:</strong> Inquiry for 5-Day Tanzania Safari - <span class="placeholder">[你的名字]</span>
        </p>
        <p>Dear Safari Operator,</p>
        <p>I am writing to inquire about a 5-day private safari tour in Tanzania. I found your company highly
            recommended and would like to request a quote based on the following details:</p>

        <ul>
            <li><strong>Travel Dates:</strong> From <span class="placeholder">[出發日期]</span> to <span
                    class="placeholder">[結束日期]</span></li>
            <li><strong>Number of Travelers:</strong> <span class="placeholder">[大人人數]</span> Adults, <span
                    class="placeholder">[小孩人數(如有) 及年齡]</span></li>
            <li><strong>Budget Level:</strong> <span class="placeholder">[Mid-range 中價位 / Luxury 奢華]</span>
                Accommodation</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Preferred Itinerary:</h2>
        <ul class="itinerary-list">
            <li><strong>Day 1:</strong> Arusha to Tarangire National Park (Afternoon game drive)</li>
            <li><strong>Day 2:</strong> Tarangire to Ngorongoro Conservation Area (Morning game drive in Tarangire,
                afternoon transfer to Ngorongoro rim)</li>
            <li><strong>Day 3:</strong> Ngorongoro Crater (Full day crater tour with picnic lunch)</li>
            <li><strong>Day 4:</strong> Ngorongoro to Lake Manyara (Transfer to Lake Manyara, afternoon game drive)</li>
            <li><strong>Day 5:</strong> Lake Manyara to Arusha (Morning game drive, afternoon transfer back to
                Arusha/Airport)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Additional Questions:</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Could you provide a detailed quote including accommodation, park fees, a 4x4 safari vehicle, and an
                English-speaking guide?</li>
            <li>Are airport transfers included in the price?</li>
            <li>What is your payment and cancellation policy?</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Looking forward to hearing from you soon.</p>
        <p>Best regards,<br><br><span class="placeholder">[你的名字]</span><br><span
                class="placeholder">[你的聯絡方式(Email或電話)]</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>Provided by Africa Travel Institute (ATI)</p>
    </div>
</body>

</html>